{
    "title": "NBC LA: News, Weather",
    "description": "The NBC Los Angeles news and weather app connects you with local news, weather forecasts and breaking headlines throughout LA and Southern California. It is your gateway to local news, weather updates, and a free NBC Los Angeles News 24/7 streaming channel. The app is free to download and easy to use, offering customizable breaking news alerts and weather notifications tailored to your location through convenient app settings.\r\n\r\nThe NBC Los Angeles app helps you stay informed with the following features:\r\n\r\nLOS ANGELES NEWS ALERTS \r\n+ Alerts for LA local news, Southern California news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings\r\n+ Top news of the day, covering breaking news, politics, weather, wildfires and earthquakes\r\n+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order\r\n+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent LA stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in LA local news and pop culture \r\n\r\nNBC LA FIRST ALERT WEATHER\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange \r\n+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts \r\n+ Exclusive Live First Alert radar tracks storms in your neighborhood with our Live Doppler Network\r\n+ Forecasts from our weather team alerting you to severe weather before it strikes\r\n+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph \r\n+ Detailed forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions \r\n+ Weather alerts for every location you see in the app\r\n+ Complete weather closings for Los Angeles-area schools\r\n+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists \r\n\r\nNBC LOS ANGELES NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL\r\n+ Free 24/7 NBC Los Angeles News streaming channel\r\n+ Live Channel 4 newscasts and streaming content\r\n+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in the LA area\r\n+ Live streams and live coverage of car chases\r\n+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed \r\n\r\nNBC4 INVESTIGATIONS & MORE\r\n+ Exclusive NBC4 I-Team stories that get results\r\n+ NBC4 Responds reports that solve your consumer problems\r\n+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks\r\n+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC\r\n+ Entertainment news from E! Online and Access \r\n+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show\r\n\r\n\r\nThe NBC Los Angeles news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=NBC_Southern_California/   \r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_Southern_California",
    "descriptionHTML": "The NBC Los Angeles news and weather app connects you with local news, weather forecasts and breaking headlines throughout LA and Southern California. It is your gateway to local news, weather updates, and a free NBC Los Angeles News 24/7 streaming channel. The app is free to download and easy to use, offering customizable breaking news alerts and weather notifications tailored to your location through convenient app settings.<br><br>The NBC Los Angeles app helps you stay informed with the following features:<br><br>LOS ANGELES NEWS ALERTS <br>+ Alerts for LA local news, Southern California news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings<br>+ Top news of the day, covering breaking news, politics, weather, wildfires and earthquakes<br>+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order<br>+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent LA stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications<br>+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in LA local news and pop culture <br><br>NBC LA FIRST ALERT WEATHER<br>+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange <br>+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts <br>+ Exclusive Live First Alert radar tracks storms in your neighborhood with our Live Doppler Network<br>+ Forecasts from our weather team alerting you to severe weather before it strikes<br>+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph <br>+ Detailed forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions <br>+ Weather alerts for every location you see in the app<br>+ Complete weather closings for Los Angeles-area schools<br>+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists <br><br>NBC LOS ANGELES NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL<br>+ Free 24/7 NBC Los Angeles News streaming channel<br>+ Live Channel 4 newscasts and streaming content<br>+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in the LA area<br>+ Live streams and live coverage of car chases<br>+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed <br><br>NBC4 INVESTIGATIONS &amp; MORE<br>+ Exclusive NBC4 I-Team stories that get results<br>+ NBC4 Responds reports that solve your consumer problems<br>+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks<br>+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC<br>+ Entertainment news from E! Online and Access <br>+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show<br><br><br>The NBC Los Angeles news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.<br><br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=NBC_Southern_California/   <br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_Southern_California",
